   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="hun.00016.001.jpg" type="recto"/>
   <note type="authorial" place="top">(sent to Herald)</note>
   <head type="main" rend="underline">Soon shall the winter's foil be here</head>
   <lg type="poem">
     <l>Soon shall the winter's foil be here</l>
     <l>Soon shall these icy ligatures unbind<lb/> and melt&#8212;<retrace cause="illegible">A</retrace> little while</l>
     <l>And air, earth, wave suffused in softness<lb/> bloom and growth&#8212;a thousand forms shall rise</l>
    <l><del rend="overstrike">up</del> from these <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">frozen</del><add place="above" seq="2">dead</add></subst> clods and chills as from low burial <gap extent="one character" reason="illegible"/> graves.</l>
    <l>Thine eyes, ears, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">all thy sense <gap extent="one word" reason="illegible"/></del><add place="above" seq="2">all thy</add></subst><lb/> <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">loftiest</del><add place="above" seq="2">best</add></subst> attributes&#8212;all that<lb/> takes cognizance of Natural beauty</l>
    <l>Shall rouse and fill&#8212;thou shal<retrace cause="illegible">t</retrace><lb/> perceive<subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1"><unclear cert="low">vital</unclear> immortal changes</del><add place="above" seq="2">the <del rend="overstrike" seq="3">eternal</del><del rend="overstrike" seq="5"><add place="above" seq="4">annual</add></del><del rend="overstrike" seq="6"> simple</del></add></subst><add place="above"><seg xml:id="alt001">delicate shows</seg></add><add place="below" xml:id="alt002">the simple miracles</add><alt target="#alt001 #alt002"/></l>
    <l>Dandelions, clover, the emerald<lb/> grass, the <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1"><gap extent="one word" reason="illegible"/></del><add seq="2">early</add></subst> scents and<lb/> flowers</l>
    <l>The arbutus under-foot, <add place="below"><metamark target="#a001" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001">The willow's yellow-green,</add> the<lb/> blossoming plum and cherry</l>
    <l>The <del rend="overstrike">birds <gap extent="one character" reason="illegible"/> the blue bird,</del><lb/> robin, lark, and thrush,<lb/> with songs&#8212;<subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the b<gap extent="one character" reason="illegible"/></del><add place="above" seq="2">the</add></subst> flitting<lb/> blue bird;</l>
    <l>For <del rend="overstrike">so</del> <add place="below"><metamark target="#a002" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002">such the scenes</add>the <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">immortal</del><add place="below" seq="2">annual</add></subst> play<del rend="overstrike" seq="1">goes</del><del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">comes</add></del><add place="above" seq="4">brings</add> on.</l>
   </lg>
   

